474
00:26:58,288 --> 00:26:59,164
Go!
ໄປ!

475
00:27:00,999 --> 00:27:01,833
Got any family?
ເຈົ້າມີຄອບຄົວບໍ?

476
00:27:01,916 --> 00:27:04,169
According to my file,
I met the girl of my dreams
